      "name": "t:sections.rich_text.presets.rich_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "width": "full-width",
        "title": "Monster Piercing | Twisted Barbells",
        "text": "<p>Twisted bars are a unique and stylish option for body piercings, offering a distinctive look that stands out from traditional straight barbells. At Monster Piercing, we provide a diverse selection of twisted bars, also known as spiral barbells, made from materials like surgical steel, titanium, and UV-reactive acrylic. These pieces are often used for piercings such as helix, lip, and navel, adding a dynamic twist to your jewelry collection. </p><p>Twisted bars are available in various designs, including those with ball, cone, and decorative ends, giving you the flexibility to customize your look. The twisted shape not only adds aesthetic appeal but also ensures a secure and comfortable fit. Whether you're looking for a subtle addition to your piercing collection or a bold statement piece, our twisted bars provide both style and functionality, making them a popular choice for those who want something a little different.</p>",
        "heading_size": "medium",
        "text_alignment": "center"
      }
    },
